{
  "sn35.113:0.1": "Linked Discourses 35.113 ",
  "sn35.113:0.2": "11. Sanctuary from the Yoke ",
  "sn35.113:0.3": "Listening In ",
  "sn35.113:1.1": "At one time the Buddha was staying at Ñātika in the brick house. ",
  "sn35.113:1.2": "Then while the Buddha was in private retreat he spoke this exposition of the teaching: ",
  "sn35.113:1.3": "“Eye consciousness arises dependent on the eye and sights. The meeting of the three is contact. ",
  "sn35.113:1.4": "Contact is a requirement for feeling. ",
  "sn35.113:1.5": "Feeling is a requirement for craving. ",
  "sn35.113:1.6": "Craving is a requirement for grasping. ",
  "sn35.113:1.7": "Grasping is a requirement for continued existence. ",
  "sn35.113:1.8": "Continued existence is a requirement for rebirth. ",
  "sn35.113:1.9": "Rebirth is a requirement for old age and death, sorrow, lamentation, pain, sadness, and distress to come to be. ",
  "sn35.113:1.10": "That is how this entire mass of suffering originates. ",
  "sn35.113:1.11": "Ear … nose … tongue … body … ",
  "sn35.113:1.12": "Mind consciousness arises dependent on the mind and ideas. The meeting of the three is contact. ",
  "sn35.113:1.13": "Contact is a requirement for feeling. ",
  "sn35.113:1.14": "Feeling is a requirement for craving. ",
  "sn35.113:1.15": "Craving is a requirement for grasping. ",
  "sn35.113:1.16": "Grasping is a requirement for continued existence. ",
  "sn35.113:1.17": "Continued existence is a requirement for rebirth. ",
